<label class="block">Nueva contraseña *<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="72" autocomplete="new-password" required class="w-full bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-2"></label>
<label class="block">Repetir nueva contraseña *<input name="confirmation" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="72" autocomplete="new-password" required class="w-full bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-2"></label>
<p class="text-secondary">Al menos 12 caracteres. Puedes usar una frase larga. No compartas tu contraseña personal.</p>
